<title>LATVIA: Unibank shares weaken, calmer on Latvian bourse.</title>
<headline>Unibank shares weaken, calmer on Latvian bourse.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unibank's shares fell on Thursday in lighter volume than recently after probing new year highs earlier this week, the Riga Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Overall market volume was 34,657 lats versus 67,229 lats on Tuesday, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>Market leader Unibanka led the way in turnover with over 23,000 lats worth of its shares changing hands but lost ground, falling 3.48 percent to 1.94 lats from Tuesday's 1996 high of 2.01 lats.</p>
<p>The Riga Transportation Fleet pursued recent gains, jumping 2.40 percent to 0.82 lats in a deal worth 5,740 lats.</p>
<p>--Riga Newsroom +3717-22 66 93</p>
</text>
